@RequestsManagement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### Default listing: newest first, page 1
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Accept: application/json

### Combined filters: handler + organization + July 2026 (half-open: createdTo is exclusive)
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests?assignedTo=דנה כהן&organizationName=רכבת ישראל - סניף חיפה&createdFrom=2026-07-01&createdTo=2026-08-01&status=Completed&sortBy=updatedAt&sortDirection=desc&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Free-text search on Title / OrganizationName
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests?search=חשבונית&priority=High
Accept: application/json

### Sort by priority: most urgent first (High > Medium > Low), newest first within each priority
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests?sortBy=priority&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json

### Validation error (400): createdFrom must be earlier than createdTo
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests?createdFrom=2026-08-01&createdTo=2026-07-01
Accept: application/json

### Update status. Take id + rowVersion from a listing above.
# X-User-Name is required (recorded as ChangedBy) and is percent-encoded UTF-8,
# because HTTP headers cannot carry Hebrew as-is: %D7%93%D7%A0%D7%94%20%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%9F = "דנה כהן".
PATCH {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: %D7%93%D7%A0%D7%94%20%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%9F

{
  "status": "InProgress",
  "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E="
}

### Bulk status update (partial success: 200 with a per-request outcome)
POST {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests/status/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: %D7%93%D7%A0%D7%94%20%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%9F

{
  "status": "InProgress",
  "items": [
    { "id": 1, "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E=" },
    { "id": 2, "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9I=" }
  ]
}

### Status change history of a request, newest first (404 if the request does not exist)
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests/1/history
Accept: application/json

### Aggregations
GET {{RequestsManagement_HostAddress}}/api/requests/summary
Accept: application/json

###
